@@ -0,0 +1,102 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+/*
+ * Copyright (C) 2025 Aleksa Sarai <cyphar@cyphar.com>
+ * Copyright (C) 2025 SUSE LLC
+ *
+ * Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
